ll","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The page param each page was fetched with, aligned by index with "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pages"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]}],[{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"<a id=\"property-pages\">"},{"type":"inlineHtml","value":"</a>"},{"type":"text","value":" "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"pages"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"TData"},{"type":"text","value":"[]"}]},{"type":"tableCell","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The data of every page fetched so far, in order."}]}]]}],"headings":[{"id":"type-parameters","text":"Type Parameters","level":2},{"id":"tdata","text":"TData","level":3},{"id":"tpageparam","text":"TPageParam","level":3},{"id":"properties","text":"Properties","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:313](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L313)\n\nThe data shape of an infinite query: every page fetched so far, plus the page param each one was fetched with.\n`pages` and `pageParams` are index-aligned — `pageParams[i]` is the param that produced `pages[i]`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-pageparams\"></a> `pageParams` | `TPageParam`[] | The page param each page was fetched with, aligned by index with `pages`. |\n| <a id=\"property-pages\"></a> `pages` | `TData`[] | The data of every page fetched so far, in order. |\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: InfiniteData\ntitle: InfiniteData\n---\n\nDefined in: [packages/query-core/src/types.ts:313](https://github.com/TanStack/query/blob/main/packages/query-core/src/types.ts#L313)\n\nThe data shape of an infinite query: every page fetched so far, plus the page param each one was fetched with.\n`pages` and `pageParams` are index-aligned — `pageParams[i]` is the param that produced `pages[i]`.\n\n## Type Parameters\n\n### TData\n\n`TData`\n\n### TPageParam\n\n`TPageParam` = `unknown`\n\n## Properties\n\n| Property | Type | Description |\n| ------ | ------ | ------ |\n| <a id=\"property-pageparams\"></a> `pageParams` | `TPageParam`[] | The page param each page was fetched with, aligned by index with `pages`. |\n| <a id=\"property-pages\"></a> `pages` | `TData`[] | The data of every page fetched so far, in order. |\n"}
